        "created_at": "2013-03-20T21:30:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wow, what would boost it that much? The Compound Bow is nice, but it isn't affected by the number of bounties that are out…so it'd only get buffed by (other than the Nemesis bonus and two damage-boosting bounties) buffs from other heroes, surely? I suppose if you had the Nemesis bonus and Galvanise and Inspiring Presence and Syncopated Onslaught and Imbued Fire and three Obsidian Fields that'd be +10 to damage, meaning two hits for eleven points each, a total of 21. Was that what you were thinking of? But that's dependent on having a particular combination of heroes and environment out, all of which having played those particular cards. Actually wait, add in six damage to each hit for Hunter and Hunted…shit that'd be seventeen damage for each of the two hits, a shot of <span class=\"bbcode-i\">thirty-four</span>! Wow that's epic, omg I hope that comes up some day :D.</p>",
